    rdfs:comment "Indicates a request for information about the beneficiary in an insurance contract. Assigned domain=Person, range=Beneficiary; This property denotes a request for beneficiary-related information. The requester is typical…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates a request for information about the beneficiary in an insurance contract."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Person ;
    rdfs:range ins:Beneficiary .

### Property: ins:requiresProofOfDeath
ins:requiresProofOfDeath
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Requires Proof Of Death"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Indicates that a party or condition requires the submission of proof of death as part of a claim or contractual obligation. Assigned domain=Person, range=ProofOfDeath; The property indicates that a party requires proof o…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates that a party or condition requires the submission of proof of death as part of a claim or contractual obligation."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Person ;
    rdfs:range ins:ProofOfDeath ;
    skos:altLabel "subject of proof of death"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "submits proof of death for"@en .

### Property: ins:startDateOfExaminationPeriod
ins:startDateOfExaminationPeriod
    a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Start Date Of Examination Period"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Specifies the start date of the examination period in an insurance contract. Assigned domain=Policy, range=xsd:date; The examination period is a time-bound contractual feature typically associated with a policy. The prop…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Specifies the start date of the examination period in an insurance contract."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Policy ;
    rdfs:range xsd:date ;
    skos:altLabel "duration of examination period"@en .

### Property: ins:terminates
ins:terminates
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Prevents Payment"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Indicates that one entity causes the termination of another entity, such as a policy being terminated by an action or condition. Assigned domain=CorporateEntity, range=Policy; The property indicates that one entity cause…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates that one entity causes the termination of another entity, such as a policy being terminated by an action or condition."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:CorporateEntity ;
    rdfs:range ins:Policy ;
    skos:altLabel "has payment obligation to avoid coverage termination"@en .

### Property: ins:triggersExclusion
ins:triggersExclusion
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Triggers Exclusion"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Indicates that a specific event or condition leads to the activation of an exclusion clause in an insurance contract. Assigned domain=Clause, range=Exclusion; The property indicates that an event or condition activates a…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates that a specific event or condition leads to the activation of an exclusion clause in an insurance contract."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Clause ;
    rdfs:range ins:Exclusion ;
    skos:altLabel "triggers response"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "triggered by"@en .

### Property: ins:triggersIncontestabilityPeriodAfterTwoYears
ins:triggersIncontestabilityPeriodAfterTwoYears
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Must Provide Evidence Of Insurability"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Indicates that a specific event or condition initiates the incontestability period that begins after two years from the effective date of the insurance contract. Assigned domain=Policy, range=Period; This property is tri…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates that a specific event or condition initiates the incontestability period that begins after two years from the effective date of the insurance contract."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Policy ;
    rdfs:range ins:Period ;
    skos:altLabel "conditional on insurability"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "restricted by incontestability period duration"@en .

### Property: ins:triggersLienDeductionAdjustment
ins:triggersLienDeductionAdjustment
    a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Administers Lien Deduction Procedure Upon Acceleration"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Indicates the event or condition that initiates the adjustment of the death benefit, including the deduction of liens, as specified in the insurance contract. Assigned domain=BenefitClaim, range=DeathBenefit; This proper…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Indicates the event or condition that initiates the adjustment of the death benefit, including the deduction of liens, as specified in the insurance contract."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:BenefitClaim ;
    rdfs:range ins:DeathBenefit ;
    skos:altLabel "triggers adjustment of death benefit including lien deduction"@en ;
    skos:altLabel "determines timing of lien deduction in adjusted death benefit calculation"@en .

### Property: ins:voidFromAbInitioDate
ins:voidFromAbInitioDate
    a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:label "Date From Which Policy Is Void Ab Initio"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Specifies the date from which the insurance policy is void ab initio, meaning it is considered invalid from its inception. Assigned domain=Policy, range=xsd:date; This property indicates the date from which a policy is v…"@en ;
    skos:definition "Specifies the date from which the insurance policy is void ab initio, meaning it is considered invalid from its inception."@en ;
    rdfs:domain ins:Policy ;
    rdfs:range xsd:date .

