        owl:someValuesFrom ins:Action
    ] ;
    rdfs:comment "Policy must meet conditions to be reinstated after lapse. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Evidence shows reinstatement requires specific actions like providing evidence of insurability and paying past due prem…"@en .

